          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você também pode adicionar várias consultas <code>@media</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss Fight Overlay\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Different screens need different HUD sizes.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;250&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/r/venn.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: #222222;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-family: Arial;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #ffcc00;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>@media</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>max-width: 2400px</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando várias regras CSS têm como alvo o mesmo elemento, a regra declarada mais tarde na folha de estilo, ou com maior especificidade, tem precedência.</p><p>Consultas de mídia seguem os mesmos princípios de substituição.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"charset\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;UTF-8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;viewport&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"content\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Your UI colors can change by screen size.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" color: #66ffcc;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #0066ff;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>h1</code> seguido de <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que usamos consultas de mídia CSS?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para aplicar estilos diferentes para dispositivos diferentes (como desktops, tablets e telefones)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para fazer a lógica do jogo rodar mais rápido</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para aplicar estilos diferentes para dispositivos diferentes (como desktops, tablets e telefones).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (min-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"200%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A consulta <code>@media</code> está faltando sua chave de fechamento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos adicionar duas regras a uma consulta <code>@media</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A consulta <code>@media</code> está faltando sua chave de fechamento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando adicionamos uma media query para garantir que os estilos se apliquem apenas em telas com menos de 600px de largura?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (max-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os estilos dentro da media query se aplicam apenas quando a largura da tela é menor que 600px</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Os estilos dentro da media query se aplicam a telas de todos os tamanhos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os estilos dentro da media query se aplicam apenas quando a largura da tela é menor que 600px.</p></body></html>"
          },
